/-!
# Arbitrary base change for the dualizing module of a flat quasi-finite algebra

The relative dualizing module of a flat quasi-finite algebra over a Noetherian base commutes with
arbitrary base change (Stacks Project, Tag 0BVF). The material is split into
`FlatAlgebraBaseChange.FiniteCase` (the comparison map and the finite flat case),
`FlatAlgebraBaseChange.LocalStructure` (bijectivity criteria and étale-local structure),
`FlatAlgebraBaseChange.TargetAway` (localizing the target of a finite open factorization),
`FlatAlgebraBaseChange.FiniteProjectiveTarget` (the finite projective case) and
`FlatAlgebraBaseChange.Bijective` (the main theorem).
-/
